    "detailed_description": "You wake up alone in a mysterious desert &amp; your task is finding out what happened!<br>To do that you will build A base, craft better Tools &amp; explore a vast desert landscape<br>consisting of various unique biomes, that come with their own challenges &amp; rewards!<br>On the Journey through the desert you will encounter many different threats<br>such as sandstorms, droughts &amp; dangerous enemies,<br>but as you'll find out there is something way darker &amp; more sinister plagueing the desert!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find a Place to cool down</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625000/extras/b656ac6c12de8423db3ca7696d77d12a.avif?t=1750363259\" width=700 height=200 /></span><br><br>It's best to find somewhere chill during a hot day in the desert. The Scorching heat might<br>make you feel dizzy or disoriented but don't worry you will find an Oasis along your way!<br>An Oasis is the perfect spot for settling down in the desert, as it does provide the most<br>essential resource, water. On top of that you might even make new friends as an Oasis<br>always remains the favourite spot for friendly desert camels eager to join your journey<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a mysterious desert landscape</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625000/extras/explore3.JPG?t=1750363259\" width=700 height=200 /></span><br><br>Explore and surive in a vast 64^2km desert landscape composed of various unique and<br>beautiful biomes, each with their own challenges! You might find yourself walking across the<br>sand dunes or stopping and taking a good look at the beautiful scenery of a massive canyon.<br>Maybe you even find one of the old temples or long-forgotten cities of an ancient civilization.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">   <li>Massive 64km^2 Map to explore &amp; uncover<br>    7 Unique Biomes, each with their own challenges &amp; rewards<br><br></li><li>Advanced Building &amp; Realistic Farming System to create your own unique home<br><br></li><li>Adaptive ai enemies learning from your every move &amp; mistake<br>    Various Frightning Creatures like the feared Serpamat trying to ruin your day<br><br></li><li>Dynamic Weather Effects like Sandstorms &amp; Droughts pushing you to your limits<br><br></li><li>Curious Desert Camels that can be tamed &amp; prove useful during longer journeys<br><br></li><li>Ancient &amp; Exciting Storyline making you question your existance</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you survive the Scorching Desert?</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625000/extras/e5c579054e104098d5dcee219f07043c.poster.avif?t=1750363259\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625000/extras/e5c579054e104098d5dcee219f07043c.webm?t=1750363259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625000/extras/e5c579054e104098d5dcee219f07043c.mp4?t=1750363259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "You wake up alone in a mysterious desert &amp; your task is finding out what happened!<br>To do that you will build A base, craft better Tools &amp; explore a vast desert landscape<br>consisting of various unique biomes, that come with their own challenges &amp; rewards!<br>On the Journey through the desert you will encounter many different threats<br>such as sandstorms, droughts &amp; dangerous enemies,<br>but as you'll find out there is something way darker &amp; more sinister plagueing the desert!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find a Place to cool down</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625000/extras/b656ac6c12de8423db3ca7696d77d12a.avif?t=1750363259\" width=700 height=200 /></span><br><br>It's best to find somewhere chill during a hot day in the desert. The Scorching heat might<br>make you feel dizzy or disoriented but don't worry you will find an Oasis along your way!<br>An Oasis is the perfect spot for settling down in the desert, as it does provide the most<br>essential resource, water. On top of that you might even make new friends as an Oasis<br>always remains the favourite spot for friendly desert camels eager to join your journey<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a mysterious desert landscape</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625000/extras/explore3.JPG?t=1750363259\" width=700 height=200 /></span><br><br>Explore and surive in a vast 64^2km desert landscape composed of various unique and<br>beautiful biomes, each with their own challenges! You might find yourself walking across the<br>sand dunes or stopping and taking a good look at the beautiful scenery of a massive canyon.<br>Maybe you even find one of the old temples or long-forgotten cities of an ancient civilization.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">   <li>Massive 64km^2 Map to explore &amp; uncover<br>    7 Unique Biomes, each with their own challenges &amp; rewards<br><br></li><li>Advanced Building &amp; Realistic Farming System to create your own unique home<br><br></li><li>Adaptive ai enemies learning from your every move &amp; mistake<br>    Various Frightning Creatures like the feared Serpamat trying to ruin your day<br><br></li><li>Dynamic Weather Effects like Sandstorms &amp; Droughts pushing you to your limits<br><br></li><li>Curious Desert Camels that can be tamed &amp; prove useful during longer journeys<br><br></li><li>Ancient &amp; Exciting Storyline making you question your existance</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you survive the Scorching Desert?</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625000/extras/e5c579054e104098d5dcee219f07043c.poster.avif?t=1750363259\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625000/extras/e5c579054e104098d5dcee219f07043c.webm?t=1750363259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625000/extras/e5c579054e104098d5dcee219f07043c.mp4?t=1750363259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
